Package: runvpn
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Nicola Danese <nicola.danese@e-projectsrl.it>
Depends: openconnect, xclip, sudo, adduser
Recommends: wl-clipboard
Homepage: https://github.com/darkfrank-it/runvpn
Description: Automate start|stop|restart operation for openconnect vpn
 runvpn is a small wrapper around openconnect that starts, stops and
 restarts a VPN connection, reading the password from the clipboard.
 Server and username are configured in /etc/runvpn.conf.
Priority: optional
Section: net
